px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n        \n      <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;\">\n              \n    <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"\" width=\"100%\">\n          <tbody>\n            \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:20px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <p style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\">\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 2px rgba(242, 247, 250, 1);font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:520px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"520px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px;word-break:break-word;\">\n                      \n      <div style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25;text-align:left;color:#000000;\"><h2 style=\"margin-top: 14pt;margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px\">Want to Make a Seller Hate You? Put This in Your LOI</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px\">Hi </span>Sara,</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Let\u2019s play a game. What\u2019s one thing you can put in your Letter of Intent that instantly makes a seller question your ability to run <em>anything</em>, much less their business?</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Answer: A 0% interest seller note.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Yikes.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I see this all the time. Some eager buyer (probably fresh off a YouTube binge) sends in an LOI offering seller financing at 0% interest\u2014as if that\u2019s a totally normal, savvy move.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Spoiler: it\u2019s not usually.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Here\u2019s why that \u201cinterest-free\u201d offer makes sellers cringe (and quietly blacklist you):</span></p><ol style=\"margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: decimal;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>It\u2019s a tax trap.</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Even if the seller agrees to 0%, the IRS doesn\u2019t. Imputed interest means the seller still pays taxes <em>as if</em> they earned interest. So you're not just offering a bad deal\u2014you're offering one that <em>costs</em> them.<br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: decimal;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>It signals you don\u2019t understand deals.</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Or at least, you haven't Googled \u201capplicable federal rate.\u201d Offering a loan below that rate without understanding the tax consequences doesn\u2019t scream \"trustworthy operator of a tax firm.\"<br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: decimal;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>It kills motivation to repay.</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br> Would you rush to pay off an interest-free loan? Neither would your seller. That\u2019s why they\u2019re unlikely to love the idea of giving you one.<br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type: decimal;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color: transparent;font-weight: 400;font-style: normal;font-variant: normal;text-decoration: none;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>It\u2019s not 2010.</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>Inflation is real. Cost of capital is real. And unless your seller is feeling wildly philanthropic, they need a very good reason why they should finance your dream at 0%.</span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">The fix?&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">At a<strong> </strong><em>minimum</em>, offer AFR (Applicable Federal Rate) on seller notes. Show the seller that you understand basic finance, tax implications, and how not to look like a rookie.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Not sure what AFR is or how to structure a seller note that doesn't make you look like a walking red flag? </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://link.msgsndr.com/email-tracking/ab0cddc1496?contactId=xoXEjJhxZU4nfwkScSXn&amp;si=igHDS5hoqJ8jj1fx&amp;utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=email marketing\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204); color: rgb(17, 85, 204); color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><u>You can watch one of my recent videos right here.</u></span></a></p><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt;margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I\u2019ll walk you through it, no fluff.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">To smarter offers and fewer declined LOIs,<br>Sara Sharp<br>Partner, SK&amp;S Law Group<br>Founder, Deal Academy<br></span></p></div>\n    \n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    <tr>\n                    <td align=\"left\" style=\"f